Falsifies `driver_process_contract::virtual_input_output::proofs::the_window_never_maps_a_withheld_page`.

The defect: `register_window` tests a withheld range against a page with `w.start <= start` in
place of `w.start < end`, so an MSI-X table that begins in the middle of a page (as tables usually
do) no longer withholds that page. The line still reads as an overlap test.

Expected to fail: the harness's withheld-range `assert!`: the window now holds a page the withheld range
overlaps, which is the MSI-X table mapped into the driver.

